%% End-to-end timeline of a full-lane task. Rendered by hand as timeline.html.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Y as You
    participant S as specify agent
    participant R as Runner
    participant T as Test agent
    participant I as Implement agent
    participant V as Review agent
    Y->>S: specify the task
    S->>S: Read instructions and nearby working examples
    S->>Y: Ask only the decisions still missing
    Y->>S: Confirm scope, checks, stages, routes, delivery
    S-->>Y: Plan files and pipeline.json, validated
    Y->>R: run --detach
    R->>R: Preflight, take the project lock, bind the plan
    R->>T: Fresh session: write the tests
    T-->>R: Test-only diff
    R->>R: Run red checks, require assertion failures, freeze test hashes
    R->>I: Fresh session: implement
    I-->>R: Code diff
    R->>R: Run green checks, bind evidence to the diff fingerprint
    R->>V: Fresh session: requirements and the actual diff (optional)
    V-->>R: Findings and in-scope corrections
    R->>R: Re-run checks and rules, then the publication guard
    R->>R: Commit, push, draft PR (when selected)
    R-->>Y: status complete, evidence on disk
